---
import DesignSystemShell from "../../layouts/DesignSystemShell.astro";
import DsSection from "../../components/design-system/DsSection.astro";
import DsRule from "../../components/design-system/DsRule.astro";
import { DS_BASE, dsChapters } from "@lib/design-system/nav";
import { tokens } from "@lib/design-system/tokens";
---

<DesignSystemShell slug="agents" source="app/command-center/src/pages/design-system/agents.astro · CLAUDE.md · CONVENTIONS.md §11">
  <DsSection id="recipe" title="Build recipe">
    <p>The steps for any new or changed surface, desktop or mobile. An agent follows them in order and cites the rule ids it applied in the PR.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Answer the five questions</strong> (<a href={DS_BASE + "#first-principles"}>Overview → First-principles method</a>) in the PR description: the decision, the unit of work, the load-bearing facts, what the user already knows, what breaks on a phone / in the dark / for a screen reader.</li>
      <li><strong>Place it in the tree.</strong> Department → surface → unit (office → vendor → branch → document → line). Add the nav leaf in <code>src/lib/nav.ts</code> as <code>soon</code> first, then <code>built</code> with an href when it ships.</li>
      <li><strong>Pick the page shape</strong> (<a href={DS_BASE + "/dashboards#shapes"}>Dashboards → Page shapes</a>): work board, audit tree, executive dashboard, map + rail, or reading page.</li>
      <li><strong>Start from a copy of the canonical surface</strong> for that shape: <code>friday-wip.astro</code> (board), <code>invoice-audit.astro</code> + <code>invoice-audit-tree.ts</code> (tree), <code>executive/pipeline.astro</code> (dashboard), <code>index.astro</code> + <code>VendorTerritoryMap.astro</code> (map). Keep its prefix convention; copy the <code>.fw</code> palette block verbatim under your prefix.</li>
      <li><strong>Tokens only.</strong> Colour, radius, spacing, font from <code>global.css</code> (<a href={DS_BASE + "/tokens.json"}>tokens.json</a>). No literal hex outside the surface palette block, no off-scale spacing, no second typeface.</li>
      <li><strong>Components from the library.</strong> Toolbar shape, KPI cards as queues, ten-row panes, pills with words, empty/loading/unavailable states, one primary, confirms that state non-effects.</li>
      <li><strong>Both modes</strong> from <code>cc.theme</code> via <code>initThemePref</code>; the trio last in the toolbar.</li>
      <li><strong>Loaders paginate</strong> (<code>.range()</code>), read materialised views, never cross a silo, never fabricate a number.</li>
      <li><strong>Deep links in and out</strong> carry scope and pre-filter on land.</li>
      <li><strong>Words</strong> per the content chapter: labels that state cost, messages that name the way out, figures from the formatter.</li>
      <li><strong>Open the page.</strong> Both modes, 1440 and 390 wide, keyboard only once, greyscale once, axe clean. Two real regressions were caught only this way.</li>
      <li><strong>Record.</strong> If a decision was made that this site does not already contain, add it to the <a href={DS_BASE + "/decisions"}>decisions log</a> in the same PR, and to <code>docs/</code> if it changes a contract.</li>
      <li><strong>Ship</strong> per the deploy contract: state the change, its user-visible impact and the rollback; push; watch <code>/healthz</code> flip.</li>
    </ol>
  </DsSection>

  <DsSection id="checklist" title="Ship checklist">
    <p>Copy into the PR. Every line is a yes or a cited reason it does not apply.</p>
    <div class="ds-pre"><code>## Design-system checklist (cc.proexteriorsus.net/design-system)
- [ ] Five first-principles questions answered (Overview)
- [ ] Placed in the department → surface → unit tree; nav leaf added (UX-01)
- [ ] Page shape named; canonical surface copied (D-01…D-04)
- [ ] Tokens only — no literal hex / spacing / font outside the surface palette block (C-01, S-01, T-01)
- [ ] One flag-red primary per viewport (C-02); gold never a control (C-03)
- [ ] Every status a pill with a word; TBD grey; no fabricated numbers (CMP-02, W-04)
- [ ] KPI cards navigate or inform; ≤ 6 (CMP-03, D-03)
- [ ] Unbounded lists: ten rows, measured pane, cost-stating control, filters before paging (CMP-04, UX-06)
- [ ] Toolbar ≤ search · office · scope · More filters · pill · count · theme (CMP-05)
- [ ] Empty / loading / unavailable states name the way out (CMP-07)
- [ ] Confirms state effect, non-effects, parties; disabled keeps tooltip (CMP-08)
- [ ] Deep links carry scope; unknown scope shows honest empty (CMP-10, UX-04)
- [ ] Light and dark from cc.theme; both screenshotted (MD-01, MD-09)
- [ ] Focus visible; targets ≥ 44 (36 on desktop boards); native elements (A-02, A-04, A-06)
- [ ] Alt text per image kind; charts labelled with a table (I-03, A-05)
- [ ] Reduced motion honoured; no new motion without a rule (MO-02, MO-06)
- [ ] 390px checked: no horizontal page scroll; inputs 16px (M-03, M-05, M-09)
- [ ] Loaders paginate; no silo-crossing aggregate; materialised view (D-10, UX-02)
- [ ] Words: sentence case, cost-stating labels, formatter figures, no literal $ / % (W-01, W-02, W-05)
- [ ] Decisions log updated for any new decision (UX-10)
- [ ] npm run build + npm test green; page opened in a browser (G-02)
- [ ] Deploy note: change · impact · rollback (G-03)</code></div>
  </DsSection>

